ent monster kinds, skills, and scary-chic looks to choose from. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/e216be85a9808fafa944e4422d4d17e0.webp?t=1730192659\" /></span><br><br>Clawdeen, Draculaura, and Frankie are your new beasties!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/49d2cd87475cae8b447e5ed2a38f567a.poster.avif?t=1730192659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/49d2cd87475cae8b447e5ed2a38f567a.webm?t=1730192659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/49d2cd87475cae8b447e5ed2a38f567a.mp4?t=1730192659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As the newest member of the Boo Crew, you\u2019re in for one hex-citing adventure!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/a5f8ca80352c1977b30411db716156ed.webp?t=1730192659\" /></span><br><br>Explore the school with your beasties Clawdeen Wolf \u2122, Draculaura \u2122, and Frankie Stein\u2122, and find creeperific clues and powerful new skills. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/1faa5cbb11788ee6c40d1a95a00b46dd.poster.avif?t=1730192659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/1faa5cbb11788ee6c40d1a95a00b46dd.webm?t=1730192659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322340/extras/1faa5cbb11788ee6c40d1a95a00b46dd.mp4?t=1730192659\" type=\"video/mp4\"