ETS \u2013</strong> Discover the secrets   of the Hidden Rooms, and what is happening at Monster High\u2122.<br><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER \u2013</strong> Be yourself. Be unique. Be a Monster\u2122. <br><strong>MEET YOUR BOO CREW \u2013</strong> Clawdeen, Draculaura, and Frankie are your new beasties!<br><strong>DISCOVER THE WORLD OF Monster High\u2122 \u2013</strong> Explore the school and all its monstrous secrets.<br><strong>UNLOCK NEW SKILLS \u2013</strong> Unlock incredible skills such as the Vampire Jump or the Gorgon Dash.<br><strong>GLOW UP YOUR STYLE \u2013</strong> Swap Monster Points for new fierce lurks and fashions!",
